Third-party components
======================

Heph is proprietary, but it is built on open-source software, and the
application bundles for macOS, Windows and Linux *redistribute* that software
inside themselves. Those licences apply to those components regardless of
Heph's own terms, and several of them carry obligations that shipping a
binary triggers.

This file is the acknowledgement those licences require. It is not legal
advice, and the list below should be reviewed before any paid release.

